THIRD-PARTY DATA AND METHODOLOGY

The lookup tables included under the data/ directory are transcribed
from the Florida Department of Environmental Protection Applicant's
Handbook Volume I (June 28, 2024), specifically Appendices N (Annual
Runoff Coefficients) and O (Dry Retention Efficiency Tables) and
Table 9.2 (Event Mean Concentrations). These tables are part of a
public Florida regulatory document and are used here for the purpose
of implementing the methodologies described in that handbook.

The calculation methodologies implemented in this software (mass
loading via Eq. 9-2, dry retention efficiency lookup, wet detention
residence-time formulas, treatment train compounding via Eq. 9-5,
and related procedures) are derived from FDEP Applicant's Handbook
Volume I and FDEP MASSLOADINGMETHODOLOGY and DETENTIONMETHODOLOGY
technical references.

